      "description": {
        "fun": "Ralts reads the feelings of people and Pokémon with the red horns on its head: warm feelings warm its own body, while hostility sends it into hiding. It usually keeps out of sight, but it will come up to people when it senses happiness, and it prefers cheerful company to gloomy. A Ralts smiling in its sleep means something good happened that day.",
        "guide": "A small Psychic- and Fairy-type Pokémon (purely Psychic before Generation 6) that senses emotions with the horns on its head. It is shy but drawn to cheerful people. It evolves into Kirlia, which becomes Gardevoir or, if male, Gallade.",
        "tagline": "A shy empath that seeks out happy people",
        "sources": [
          {
            "title": "Bulbapedia: Ralts (Pokémon)",
            "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Ralts_(Pok%C3%A9mon)"
