        "ja": "サーナイト",
        "ko": "가디안",
        "ja-Hrkt": "サーナイト",
        "zh-Hans": "沙奈朵",
        "zh-Hant": "沙奈朵"
      },
      "description": {
        "fun": "Gardevoir will protect its Trainer with its life, and its power peaks when it does, letting it create small black holes and see the future. It can hold itself free of gravity, and it even sleeps upright, ready to protect people at any moment. Its name mixes the French for guard and duty, and its look combines a ballet dancer with a knight.",
        "guide": "A Psychic- and Fairy-type Pokémon (purely Psychic before Generation 6), one of Ralts's two final forms, with a gown-like body. It can see the future and will protect its Trainer with all its power. It can Mega Evolve into Mega Gardevoir, and the Paradox Pokémon Iron Valiant is said to be a future relative.",
        "tagline": "A devoted psychic guardian in a ballerina's gown",
        "sources": [
          {
            "title": "Bulbapedia: Gardevoir (Pokémon)",
            "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Gardevoir_(Pok%C3%A9mon)"
