        "zh-Hans": "艾路雷朵",
        "zh-Hant": "艾路雷朵"
      },
      "description": {
        "fun": "Gallade is a master of courtesy and the sword: it extends blades from its elbows, sharper than any human-made sword, and reads its foe's moves to strike first. It senses when someone needs help and seeks them out, and it sleeps on one knee, ready to leap up and protect them. Its name blends gallant and blade.",
        "guide": "A Psychic- and Fighting-type Pokémon introduced in Generation 4, which a male Kirlia becomes when exposed to a Dawn Stone. It fights with blades that extend from its elbows and is protective of its Trainer. It can Mega Evolve into Mega Gallade.",
        "tagline": "A chivalrous psychic knight with blades on its elbows",
        "sources": [
          {
            "title": "Bulbapedia: Gallade (Pokémon)",
            "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Gallade_(Pok%C3%A9mon)"
